&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at diagnosing and resolving complex technical issues across hardware, software, and network layers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy learning and working with new technologies and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with command-line tools for troubleshooting and system management (e.g., Bash, PowerShell)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You feel at home scripting and automating tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand and can configure networking protocols (TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re skilled in creating backup solutions and disaster recovery plans, and you regularly test recovery processes to ensure reliability&lt;/li&gt;
